      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "TOO MANY THOUGHTS (5) may have suffered from the dreaded second-up syndrome last time out but the form prior was full of merit. Has a win and a second from three attempts over this trip and should get a cosy run in transit from the inside alley. Sure to prove very hard to hold out. LAST COMMAND (1) is a consistent conveyance who is yet to miss a drum in four spins around this circuit and gets some weight relief with the 1.5kg claim. Can run a big race while fresh. You'd love to own a stable full of gallopers like ENFORCEABLE (6) who has only missed a place once in 12 career efforts. Honest campaigner and has to be included. PUFF 'N' HARRY (7) saves his best form for this trip and looks one for the exotics players. FREELAND (4) strips fitter second-up from the spell and may earn some minor money.",
